#ASSERT `s 30(2): the day service by registered post is deemed to have been effected` FALSE `and` TRUE `or` FALSE `unless` FALSE `with` (Date 10 3 2026) `where` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30(2): the day service by registered post is deemed to have been effected` TRUE `and` TRUE `or` FALSE `unless` FALSE `with` (Date 10 3 2026) `where` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

